*KEYWORD
*TITLE
Geofoam ball-indent test (3x3x2 in block, 1.68 in ball, MAT_075 EPS-12)
$ Units: in - lbf - s consistent (psi, lbf*s^2/in^4)
*CONTROL_TERMINATION
$#  endtim    endcyc     dtmin    endeng    endmas
    2.0000         0       0.0       0.0       0.0
*CONTROL_TIMESTEP
$#  dtinit    tssfac      isdo    tslimt     dt2ms      lctm     erode     ms1st
       0.0       0.9         0       0.0  -1.0E-05         0         0         0
*CONTROL_OUTPUT
$#   npopt    neecho    nrefup    iaccop     opifs    ipnint    ikedit    iflush
         1         3         0         1         0         0       100         0
*DATABASE_BINARY_D3PLOT
$#      dt
    0.0200
*DATABASE_GLSTAT
    0.0050
*DATABASE_RCFORC
    0.0050
*DATABASE_NODOUT
    0.0050
*DATABASE_MATSUM
    0.0050
